{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And you shall make a basin.</b> Since it is only for the preparation of a commandment, its command to make was not written above with the rest of the vessels." "<b>A basin of copper and its base of copper.</b> They did not have staves, and they were carried on the wagons." "<b>Between the tent of meeting and the altar.</b> Outside, so that they enter pure to perform the service."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:01:12.877544694Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}